    {
      "id": "II-infra-01G8-proofparagraph",
      "statement_id": "cdp:st:D.2.1",
      "tag": "01G8",
      "source_sha256": "a1d4fd6902cf13e774f672d2de4704460737a1f5ad82b036e4612045852eb119",
      "before": "\\noindent\\textbf{Step 1.} The base is $\\PP^1$ by \\ref{cdp:st:D.1.2}. Trivial monodromy on the\nfour-dimensional $H_1(F;\\Q)$ gives $t'=4$, so the corrected formula\ngives $r=s+3$. If all removed fibres were irreducible one would have\n$r=s$, which is impossible. The assertion about each component is\nStatement \\ref{cdp:st:C.3.4}, applied to this threefold. The last assertion follows\nby combining these two conclusions.",
      "after": "Pullback on first rational cohomology from the base is injective because\nthe fibres are connected. Thus the base is $\\PP^1$. Trivial monodromy on\nthe four-dimensional $H_1(F;\\Q)$ gives $t'=4$, and the count in\nProposition~\\ref{cdp:st:D.1.2} gives $r=s+3$. If all removed fibres were\nirreducible one would have $r=s$, which is impossible. The assertion\nabout each component is Proposition~\\ref{cdp:st:C.3.4}, applied to this\nthreefold. Such a reducible fibre prevents all fibre components from\nadmitting compact K\\\"ahler resolutions.",
      "type": "D08/D22",
      "reason": "Supply the actual rational base-genus argument from connected fibres and b1(Y)=0 before applying the general component-count identity. The printed D.1.2 base=P1 conclusion is stated under stronger integral assumptions, so it is not used as an unqualified citation here. Keep every numerical formula and both reference targets, replace the corrected-formula/process wording, and state the final deduction explicitly.",
      "original_full_block": "agents/ii_infra/first_four_guard_blocks/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_II_01G8_before.tex",
      "original_full_block_sha256": "c9b45c7182f3eeeeccff204df6c87606b649bf2f4eaea664889a4317b244c99f",
      "proposed_full_block": "agents/ii_infra/first_four_guard_blocks/S6_SERIES_PUBLISH_II_01G8_after.tex",
      "proposed_full_block_sha256": "b785c7b549110d2d21648f1a905fcddc5632c56682e16069ae7e109295dd7b16",
      "frozen_target_source_sha256": "74497bfe327fae25c9cdcb17334b3bf42a9793a9df7c0a4404d97568f2f760f0",
      "inline_math_preservation": "exact sequence",
